# MiniMax H3 prompt presets — one env file for this entire prompt category
H3_PRESET_FAMILY="creative_brief"
H3_PRESETS_JSON={"Action Chase":"Create a spatially coherent action chase with readable pursuit direction, escalating obstacles and one decisive finishing beat.","Architecture Showcase":"Create an architectural showcase that establishes the building's environment, reveals its form and guides the viewer through key spatial relationships.","Automotive Hero":"Create a cinematic automotive film that presents the vehicle's design, movement and road presence while preserving exact body shape, paint and wheel details.","Beauty Portrait":"Create an intimate beauty portrait that preserves the subject's identity while revealing makeup, hair, skin texture and expression through elegant camera movement.","Beverage Refreshment":"Create a refreshing beverage commercial built around condensation, pouring, effervescence and a satisfying final product hold.","Comedy Beat":"Create a concise visual-comedy scene with clear setup, escalating action, readable reaction and a precisely timed punchline hold.","Corporate Brand Story":"Create a concise corporate brand story that connects people, process and outcome through credible workplace action and polished visual continuity.","Dance Performance":"Create a dance film that preserves full-body choreography, musical timing and spatial continuity while building toward a memorable final pose.","Educational Demonstration":"Create a clear educational demonstration that introduces the objective, shows each essential action in order and ends with the completed result.","Event Highlight":"Create a dynamic event highlight that establishes the venue, captures authentic participant energy and finishes on the defining celebratory moment.","Family Memory":"Create a warm family-memory film with authentic shared activity, recognizable relationships and a sincere final group moment.","Fantasy Quest":"Create a cinematic fantasy quest that establishes the hero, magical objective and environmental stakes before ending on a decisive discovery.","Fashion Runway":"Create a fashion runway film in which the featured model confidently presents the selected wardrobe and accessories while moving through a visually coherent venue.","Fitness Motivation":"Create a motivational fitness film with one readable training progression, credible physical effort and a strong final achievement beat.","Food Commercial":"Create an appetizing food commercial showing preparation, texture, serving and the final dish with believable steam, ingredients and tactile detail.","Home Interior":"Create an inviting interior-design film that moves naturally through the space and highlights materials, light, furniture and practical human use.","Lifestyle Morning":"Create a warm lifestyle story that follows the subject through a natural morning routine and makes the featured products feel useful, desirable and authentic.","Luxury Product Reveal":"Create a premium product-reveal film that introduces the hero product through controlled anticipation, tactile interaction and a final immaculate beauty view.","Minimal Product Study":"Create a minimal product study focused on silhouette, material, function and precise motion, ending on a clean uninterrupted hero frame.","Music Performance":"Create a performance film centered on the artist's presence, accurate instrument or vocal action and expressive synchronization with the music.","Mystery Suspense":"Create a suspense sequence that plants a clear visual clue, increases uncertainty through camera and sound, and ends on a revealing final beat.","Nature Documentary":"Create a concise nature-documentary sequence that establishes habitat, follows one observable behavior and preserves realistic animal and environmental motion.","Pet Adventure":"Create a playful pet adventure with readable animal behavior, safe environmental interaction and a charming final reaction.","Romantic Moment":"Create an understated romantic scene built from natural interaction, meaningful eye contact, environmental atmosphere and a gentle emotional resolution.","Science Fiction Mission":"Create a grounded science-fiction mission with coherent technology, spatially readable action and a controlled climactic reveal.","Seasonal Celebration":"Create a festive seasonal campaign with recognizable decorations, shared activity, product integration and a warm final tableau.","Sports Fashion Walk":"Create a sports-fashion campaign in which the featured model walks with runway confidence through an active athletic location while clearly presenting the outfit and bag.","Streetwear Campaign":"Create an energetic streetwear campaign following the subject through a real urban environment with confident attitude, readable clothing details and contemporary rhythm.","Technology Launch":"Create a precise technology launch film that reveals the device, demonstrates its real function and ends on a clear premium product statement.","Transformation Before After":"Create a transformation film that clearly establishes the initial state, shows the motivated change and matches composition for a convincing final comparison.","Travel Destination":"Create an aspirational travel film that introduces the subject, destination and local atmosphere through clear geographic progression and memorable hero moments.","Workshop Craft":"Create a tactile craft film showing the maker, tools, material transformation and finished object through clear cause-and-effect actions."}
